        <h2 class="text-[15px] font-semibold tracking-tight fg">Third-party trademarks</h2>
        <p>
          Company names and logos shown on this site — including Rivalry,
          Yohoho, Epulze, NCGC, and Content Lab — are trademarks of their
          respective owners. They appear solely to identify projects I worked
          on. Their use implies no affiliation with, endorsement by, or
          sponsorship from those companies.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-[15px] font-semibold tracking-tight fg">Portfolio disclaimer</h2>
        <p>
          Metrics and outcomes shown on this site (for example, transaction
          volume, ROAS, community size) are historical results from my
          professional work, presented for illustration. They are not a promise
          or warranty of similar results, and nothing on this site constitutes
          professional, legal, or financial advice.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-[15px] font-semibold tracking-tight fg">Acceptable use</h2>
        <p>
          You agree not to interfere with the site's operation, not to
          misrepresent its content as your own, and not to use it in violation
          of applicable law.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-[15px] font-semibold tracking-tight fg">Third-party links</h2>
        <p>
          Links to external sites are provided for convenience. I do not
          control them and am not responsible for their content or policies.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-[15px] font-semibold tracking-tight fg">No warranties</h2>
        <p>
          The site is provided "as is", without warranties of any kind, express
          or implied, including availability, accuracy, or fitness for a
          purpose.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-[15px] font-semibold tracking-tight fg">Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the maximum extent permitted by law, I am not liable for indirect,
          incidental, or consequential damages arising from use of the site.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-[15px] font-semibold tracking-tight fg">Governing law</h2>
        <p>
          These terms are governed by the laws of the Republic of the
          Philippines.
